{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54352","headline":"鑪养丹歌 · 归耕子","name":"鑪养丹歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六十时中运丙丁，每用随时辨五行。\n阳气进时顺天转，阴气灭候逐星征。\n常以加临须正午，冈宿周来至药成。\n（《正统道藏》本《神仙链丹点铸三元宝照法》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"归耕子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}